01:01:43,636 --> 01:01:49,636
It Might Get Loud is a 2008 American documentary
film by filmmaker Davis Guggenheim.

8
01:10:32,727 --> 01:10:38,727
It explores the careers and musical styles of prominent rock
guitarists Jimmy Page, the Edge, and Jack White.

9
